Dialogue: 5,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Philippine news in eighty\Nseconds.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:02.66,0:00:05.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Three updates, checked\NOctober third.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:06.09,0:00:08.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}First, GCash parent\Ncompany Mynt
Dialogue: 5,0:00:08.94,0:00:10.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}has set its initial\Npublic
Dialogue: 5,0:00:10.19,0:00:11.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}offering price at six\Npesos
Dialogue: 5,0:00:11.87,0:00:14.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}and sixty centavos per\Nshare.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:14.51,0:00:16.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}GMA News reports the\Nplanned
Dialogue: 5,0:00:16.21,0:00:18.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Philippine Stock Exchange\Nlisting is
Dialogue: 5,0:00:18.10,0:00:19.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}October twentieth.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:20.05,0:00:21.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}The company says the\Ntimetable
Dialogue: 5,0:00:21.59,0:00:23.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}remains subject to\Napprovals and
Dialogue: 5,0:00:23.19,0:00:24.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}other conditions.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.10,0:00:27.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Second, the Climate\NChange Commission
Dialogue: 5,0:00:27.40,0:00:29.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}is calling for stronger\Npreparation
Dialogue: 5,0:00:29.30,0:00:30.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}as El Nino could\Nintensify
Dialogue: 5,0:00:30.82,0:00:31.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}before the end of this
Dialogue: 5,0:00:31.84,0:00:32.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}year.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:33.03,0:00:34.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}In an October second\Nrelease
Dialogue: 5,0:00:34.60,0:00:36.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}carried by the Philippine\NInformation
Dialogue: 5,0:00:36.42,0:00:38.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Agency, it urged\Ndecisions guided
Dialogue: 5,0:00:38.73,0:00:40.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}by science, data, and\Nrisk
Dialogue: 5,0:00:40.51,0:00:42.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}information.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:42.11,0:00:43.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}The advisory highlights\Nrisks of
Dialogue: 5,0:00:43.82,0:00:46.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}below normal rainfall,\Ndry spells,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:46.66,0:00:48.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}and drought in some\Nareas.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:49.11,0:00:51.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Third, Jeus Gabriel\NDerick Yape
Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.48,0:00:53.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}won gold in mixed\Nindividual
Dialogue: 5,0:00:53.14,0:00:55.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}virtual taekwondo at the\NAsian
Dialogue: 5,0:00:55.01,0:00:56.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Games in Japan.
