Dialogue: 5,0:00:58.50,0:00:59.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}reports that he beat his
Dialogue: 5,0:00:59.76,0:01:01.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Vietnamese opponent two\Nrounds to
